                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May 15,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Brazilian Government has recalled its minister at Lisbon and given passports
                    to the chargé d’affaires of Portugal.</p>
